### Nimbus CRM API: every endpoint, ready to send.
###
### Needs the "REST Client" extension for VS Code (humao.rest-client), or IntelliJ's HTTP client.
### Send the three sign-in requests first: the tokens they return are reused below as
### {{admin.response.body.token}}, {{aisha...}} and {{ben...}}.

@base = http://localhost:5080/api

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- Sign in

# @name admin
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@nimbus.test", "password": "Admin#2026" }

###
# @name aisha
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "aisha@nimbus.test", "password": "Rep#2026" }

###
# @name ben
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ben@nimbus.test", "password": "Rep#2026" }

### Expect 401 INVALID_CREDENTIALS
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@nimbus.test", "password": "wrong" }

### Expect 400 VALIDATION_FAILED naming email and password
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Who am I?
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{aisha.response.body.token}}

### Expect 401 UNAUTHENTICATED: no token
GET {{base}}/deals

### Everyone who can own a deal (ADMIN only; a rep gets 403)
GET {{base}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.token}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- Accounts

GET {{base}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{aisha.response.body.token}}

###
GET {{base}}/accounts/A-0008
Authorization: Bearer {{aisha.response.body.token}}

###
GET {{base}}/accounts/A-0008/contacts
Authorization: Bearer {{aisha.response.body.token}}

### Add an account (ADMIN)
POST {{base}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Test Co", "industry": "Software", "country": "United Kingdom", "website": "https://example.com" }

### Expect 403 FORBIDDEN: a rep cannot add an account
POST {{base}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{aisha.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Not allowed" }

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- Contacts

GET {{base}}/contacts?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{aisha.response.body.token}}

###
GET {{base}}/contacts?page=0&size=20&status=CUSTOMER
Authorization: Bearer {{aisha.response.body.token}}

###
GET {{base}}/contacts/search?q=fenwick
Authorization: Bearer {{aisha.response.body.token}}

###
GET {{base}}/contacts/C-00089
Authorization: Bearer {{aisha.response.body.token}}

### Add a contact (ADMIN)
POST {{base}}/contacts
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "accountRef": "A-0008", "firstName": "Test", "lastName": "Person", "email": "test.person@example.com", "jobTitle": "Buyer" }

### Edit a contact (ADMIN)
PUT {{base}}/contacts/C-00013
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "Piotr", "lastName": "Novotny", "email": "piotr.novotny@brightmoor.dental", "phone": "+44 20 7823 3407", "jobTitle": "Technical Director", "status": "PROSPECT" }

### Bulk import (ADMIN). The file is in ../docs/sample-leads.csv
POST {{base}}/contacts/import
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: text/csv

< ../docs/sample-leads.csv

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- Activities

GET {{base}}/contacts/C-00001/activities
Authorization: Bearer {{aisha.response.body.token}}

### Log a call (any signed-in user)
POST {{base}}/contacts/C-00001/activities
Authorization: Bearer {{aisha.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "CALL", "subject": "Follow-up", "notes": "Asked for the revised quote.", "occurredAt": "2026-10-22T10:30:00Z" }

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- Deals (reading)

### A rep sees only their own deals; the admin sees all 32
GET {{base}}/deals?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{aisha.response.body.token}}

###
GET {{base}}/deals?page=0&size=20&stage=NEGOTIATION
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.token}}

### Expect 400 with fields.stage
GET {{base}}/deals?stage=NEGOTIATIONS
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.token}}

### The pipeline board numbers (scoped to the caller)
GET {{base}}/deals/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.token}}

###
GET {{base}}/deals/D-00016
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.token}}

###
GET {{base}}/deals/D-00016/history
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.token}}

### D-00016 is Ben's. Expect 404 for Aisha, as if it did not exist
GET {{base}}/deals/D-00016
Authorization: Bearer {{aisha.response.body.token}}

###
GET {{base}}/contacts/C-00003/deals
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.token}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- Deals (changing)

# @name newDeal
POST {{base}}/deals
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Fleet telematics pilot", "accountRef": "A-0008", "contactRef": "C-00001", "value": 25000, "expectedCloseDate": "2027-03-31", "ownerRef": "U-0002" }

### Expect 400 naming every problem
POST {{base}}/deals
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "", "accountRef": "A-0008", "contactRef": "C-00001", "value": 0, "expectedCloseDate": "2020-01-01" }

### Expect 400 fields.contactRef: C-00001 works at A-0008, not A-0001
POST {{base}}/deals
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Wrong account", "accountRef": "A-0001", "contactRef": "C-00001", "value": 100, "expectedCloseDate": "2027-01-31" }

### Edit (ADMIN)
PUT {{base}}/deals/{{newDeal.response.body.dealRef}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Fleet telematics pilot, phase one", "value": 27500, "expectedCloseDate": "2027-04-30" }

### Move one stage forward (Aisha owns it, so she may)
POST {{base}}/deals/{{newDeal.response.body.dealRef}}/stage
Authorization: Bearer {{aisha.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "stage": "QUALIFIED" }

### Expect 409 DEAL_STAGE_TRANSITION_INVALID: two stages at once
POST {{base}}/deals/{{newDeal.response.body.dealRef}}/stage
Authorization: Bearer {{aisha.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "stage": "NEGOTIATION" }

### Lose it (needs a reason)
POST {{base}}/deals/{{newDeal.response.body.dealRef}}/stage
Authorization: Bearer {{aisha.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "stage": "LOST", "lostReason": "Budget moved to next year" }

### Expect 409 DEAL_DELETE_NOT_ALLOWED: only PROSPECTING deals can be deleted
DELETE {{base}}/deals/{{newDeal.response.body.dealRef}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.token}}

### Expect 403: a rep cannot delete
DELETE {{base}}/deals/D-00001
Authorization: Bearer {{aisha.response.body.token}}
